@.str.13 = private unnamed_addr constant [74 x i8] c"  - When multiple write ports are never accessed at the same time (a SAT\0A\00", align 1
@.str.14 = private unnamed_addr constant [80 x i8] c"    solver is used to determine this), then the ports are merged into a single\0A\00", align 1
@.str.15 = private unnamed_addr constant [80 x i8] c"    write port.  This transformation can be disabled with the \22-nosat\22 option.\0A\00", align 1
@.str.16 = private unnamed_addr constant [78 x i8] c"Note that in addition to the algorithms implemented in this pass, the $memrd\0A\00", align 1
@.str.17 = private unnamed_addr constant [81 x i8] c"and $memwr cells are also subject to generic resource sharing passes (and other\0A\00", align 1
